          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
  I am a mathematician and computer scientist.
  I work on <fr:link href="/dhsorens-0020/" title="Protocol Snarkification" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-0020/" display-uri="dhsorens-0020" type="local">Protocol Snarkification</fr:link> at the <fr:link href="/dhsorens-ef/" title="Ethereum Foundation" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-ef/" display-uri="dhsorens-ef" type="local">Ethereum Foundation</fr:link>, and these days I am mostly interested in <fr:link href="/dhsorens-lean/" title="The Lean Theorem Prover" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-lean/" display-uri="dhsorens-lean" type="local">Lean</fr:link>.  
</html:p>
            <html:p>
  Here you can see my <fr:link href="/dhsorens-rsrch/" title="Research" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-rsrch/" display-uri="dhsorens-rsrch" type="local">research</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/dhsorens-notes/" title="Notes" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-notes/" display-uri="dhsorens-notes" type="local">notes</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/dhsorens-logs/" title="Logs" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-logs/" display-uri="dhsorens-logs" type="local">logs</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/dhsorens-001C/" title="Work Bio" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-001C/" display-uri="dhsorens-001C" type="local">work history</fr:link>, and <fr:link href="/dhsorens/" title="Derek Sorensen" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens/" display-uri="dhsorens" type="local">bio</fr:link>.</html:p>
            <html:p><fr:link href="https://github.com/dhsorens" type="external">GitHub</fr:link> | <fr:link href="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4937-6984" type="external">ORCID</fr:link> | <fr:link href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dhsorens/" type="external">LinkedIn</fr:link></html:p>
            <fr:tree show-metadata="false">
              <fr:frontmatter>
                <fr:authors>
                  <fr:author>
                    <fr:link href="/dhsorens/" title="Derek Sorensen" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens/" display-uri="dhsorens" type="local">Derek Sorensen</fr:link>
