                <fr:route>/dhsorens-001S/</fr:route>
                <fr:title text="Latest Deep-Dive">Latest Deep-Dive</fr:title>
                <fr:meta name="toc">true</fr:meta>
              </fr:frontmatter>
              <fr:mainmatter>
                <html:p>
    See my latest on <fr:link href="/dhsorens-004D/" title="Hash Functions in Bitcoin and Ethereum" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-004D/" display-uri="dhsorens-004D" type="local">hash functions in Bitcoin and Ethereum</fr:link> — what each chain actually hashes with, and why the Ethereum Foundation abandoned <fr:link href="/dhsorens-004H/" title="Poseidon, and Why Ethereum Walked Away" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-004H/" display-uri="dhsorens-004H" type="local">Poseidon</fr:link> for L1 in August 2026, which was not a break of Poseidon but a change on the proving side. The systematic study behind it is <fr:link href="/dhsorens-002C/" title="zkVMs and SNARKs" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-002C/" display-uri="dhsorens-002C" type="local">zkVMs and SNARKs</fr:link>.
</html:p>
